OL,3,GNEWSABenefits cheat who falsely claimed
OL,4,A#50,000 jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA benefits cheat who falsely claimed
OL,7,Fmore than #50,000 has been jailed after
OL,8,Fhe was seen driving to work at his
OL,9,Fvehicle repair business.
OL,11,FNathan Wood, 58, of Beacon Road in
OL,12,FBradford, was diagnosed with rheumatoid
OL,13,Farthritis in 2014 but "overstated his
OL,14,Fsymptoms" and made a fraudulent claim
OL,15,Ffor a personal independence payment
OL,16,F(PIP) a year later.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
